OL,3,ANobel peace laureate says US sanctions
OL,4,Aon ICC 'unacceptable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNavi Pillay, the winner of this year's
OL,7,FNobel Peace Prize, has called US
OL,8,Fsanctions on the International Criminal
OL,9,FCourt (ICC) "unheard of" and
OL,10,F"unacceptable".
OL,12,FThe South African former ICC judge was
OL,13,Fawarded the prize on Friday "for her
OL,14,Fefforts to promote peace and
OL,15,Finternational law", which paved the way
OL,16,Ffor a "more comprehensive global legal
OL,17,Forder", the Nobel committee said.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
