OL,3,ANobel peace laureate says US sanctions
OL,4,Aon ICC 'unacceptable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump expressed his
OL,7,Fdisatisfaction with the pick and hours
OL,8,Flater the US unveiled sweeping
OL,9,Fsanctions in a significant acceleration
OL,10,Fof its attempt to "dismantle" what it
OL,11,Fdescribed as a "rogue" institution.
OL,13,FThe ICC said the measures were an
OL,14,Fassault on the rule of law and the
OL,15,Ffoundations of the international legal
OL,16,Forder.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
